{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And his soul cleaved to Dinah.</b> Dinah was at that time eight years and one month old, for so the Sages, blessed be their memory, expounded: Dinah was born before Joseph, and Joseph was born at the end of fourteen years from Jacob's arrival in Haran; he served Laban with his sheep for six years and departed; he spent eighteen months at Succoth and came to Shechem. Thus Joseph was seven and a half years old, and Dinah was older than him by seven months — so Dinah was at that time eight years and one month old."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:17:29.966114845Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}